## Author comments

Write notes to yourself inline %% like this one %% and they disappear from the output.
Use them for TODOs, sources and reminders.

## Tracked changes

Reviewers suggest edits with review markup:

| Write                     | Means                        |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `{++added++}`             | Insert text                  |
| `{--removed--}`           | Delete text                  |
| `{~~old~>new~~}`          | Replace text                 |
| `{==text==}{>>note<<}`    | Comment on text              |
| `{>>note<<}`              | Standalone comment           |

